# The agent image needs a handful of files (the tmux config, the entrypoint, the four pi extensions) and
# two build contexts (vendor/ttyd for the ttyd builder stage). Everything else is either history or
# scratch, and the build context is shipped over the wire to the daemon on every build:
#
#   .git            60M of it, and no instruction reads it
#   vendor/xterm.js   the fork is only needed by hack/build-ttyd-client.sh, which runs in a container of
#                     its own; the image build consumes the generated header committed in vendor/ttyd
#   hack/           testbed scripts, CDP probes and screenshots
.git
vendor/xterm.js
hack
**/node_modules
*.png
